1
00:00:11,361 --> 00:00:13,802
When they need an enemy - they build one.

2
00:00:15,162 --> 00:00:16,702
When they don’t - they erase it.

3
00:00:16,762 --> 00:00:17,962
The only thing they fear

4
00:00:18,442 --> 00:00:19,462
is you realizing

5
00:00:20,442 --> 00:00:22,042
the enemy lives inside.

6
00:00:22,342 --> 00:00:24,683
Everything scripted, no glitch in the frame,

7
00:00:25,123 --> 00:00:27,363
Enemy assigned - numbers enter the game.

8
00:00:27,423 --> 00:00:30,063
Heads nod worldwide, yeah, moving on beat,

9
00:00:30,363 --> 00:00:32,944
But under that rhythm - somebody’s life bleeds.

10
00:00:33,224 --> 00:00:36,204
Russia, States, China, Europe in rows,

11
00:00:36,584 --> 00:00:38,824
Puppets on stage where you don’t see the ropes.

12
00:00:38,904 --> 00:00:40,845
And if you think someone’s not in the play -

13
00:00:40,865 --> 00:00:43,045
He’s just cast for the very next stage.

14
00:00:43,185 --> 00:00:47,625
Controlled enemy, controlled fear,

15
00:00:48,105 --> 00:00:52,766
Everything planned - even this collapse here.

16
00:00:53,006 --> 00:00:59,447
I stand still, can’t believe my eyes,

17
00:00:59,507 --> 00:01:03,687
World keeps spinning - I’m outside the lines.

18
00:01:03,707 --> 00:01:08,288
They need conflict to balance the scale,

19
00:01:08,848 --> 00:01:11,368
They need an enemy to burn the advance sale.

20
00:01:11,388 --> 00:01:13,688
Media paints good and evil in frames,

21
00:01:13,768 --> 00:01:16,609
But it’s business, brother - profit and flames.

22
00:01:17,009 --> 00:01:19,189
They play the crowd through panic and feeds,

23
00:01:19,549 --> 00:01:21,869
Fake news, marches, posts and tweets.

24
00:01:22,129 --> 00:01:24,389
You stare at the screen, hunting for truth,

25
00:01:24,669 --> 00:01:26,610
But you find an algorithm, not proof.

26
00:01:26,770 --> 00:01:31,290
Controlled enemy, controlled fear,

27
00:01:31,710 --> 00:01:37,831
Everything planned - even this collapse here.

28
00:01:38,231 --> 00:01:42,091
I stand still, can’t believe my eyes,

29
00:01:42,751 --> 00:01:48,392
World keeps spinning - I’m outside the lines.

30
00:01:49,112 --> 00:01:51,832
I watched walls fall, flags decay,

31
00:01:52,292 --> 00:01:54,513
Promises taxed and swept away.

32
00:01:55,353 --> 00:01:57,373
While they code another blockchain chain,

33
00:01:57,413 --> 00:02:00,153
I choose one thing - stay unknown, unchained.

34
00:02:00,353 --> 00:02:02,834
My enemy’s not in DC or Kremlin halls,

35
00:02:02,874 --> 00:02:05,594
He’s in me - when I let my brother fall.

36
00:02:05,614 --> 00:02:08,154
When I stay silent, when faith goes thin,

37
00:02:08,174 --> 00:02:10,194
That’s where the script turns beast within.

38
00:02:10,214 --> 00:02:13,035
They need an enemy so we forget who’s near,

39
00:02:13,255 --> 00:02:15,815
So brother sees brother as something to fear.

40
00:02:15,995 --> 00:02:18,595
But we’re not actors, not files to compile,

41
00:02:18,635 --> 00:02:21,376
We’re the ones who survived - outside their style.

42
00:02:21,596 --> 00:02:24,656
Let them keep enemies by charts and plans,

43
00:02:24,796 --> 00:02:29,497
I’ve got friends, family, mother, my clan.

44
00:02:29,837 --> 00:02:36,997
I don’t believe in the enemy they sell,

45
00:02:38,218 --> 00:02:43,778
I believe in the light - and while it’s here, there’s no hell.

